* open it with the same forward animation;
* target remains bound and hidden until it starts emerging.

release

* place the enemy at the exit portal;
* make it visibly emerge;
* release the bind at the correct release frame;
* resolve releaseHit exactly once:

damage: 10
baseLaunch: 1
directionalLaunch: 'vertical'

